  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 9 adds compiled-package public-symbol comparison and AppSourceCop compatibility\n      validation for direct, configured, and recursively discovered multi-app repositories.\n      It includes ruleset support, readable comparison reports, dependency-aware baseline\n      staging, validation processing-time summaries, and protection against downgrading newer\n      cached Microsoft symbols when a feed only offers an older fallback package.\n      See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
